BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Film Night:
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260509T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260509T213000
UID:8971f19651c5dc3787200896@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Arrival follows a linguist who must learn to communicate with 
 extra-terrestrial visitors\, discovering that true understanding requires 
 deep listening and a willingness to see beyond our limited way of seeing t
 hings. A moving\, thought-provoking film about connection\, impermanence\,
  and the choices that shape our lives.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/film-night-2026-05-09
END:VEVENT
